# ============================================================================
#  INERT ON THE CURRENT HOST — read before trusting anything below.
# ============================================================================
#
#  This file is a Netlify / Cloudflare Pages feature. The app is deployed to
#  GitHub Pages (.github/workflows/deploy.yml -> actions/deploy-pages), which
#  does NOT read `_headers` at all.
#
#  Verified against production: every asset, including the versioned
#  `style.css?v=...`, comes back from y-bow.github.io with
#
#      Cache-Control: max-age=600
#
#  and none of the `immutable` / `must-revalidate` rules below are applied.
#
#  So the real caching story for this project is:
#
#    1. scripts/build.mjs rewrites every asset reference with `?v=BUILD_ID`.
#       A new deploy therefore points at brand-new URLs, so nothing can be
#       served stale regardless of what the origin's cache headers say.
#    2. sw.js precaches those versioned URLs into a versioned Cache Storage
#       bucket and serves them cache-first.
#
#  The rules are kept here for the day the project moves to Netlify or
#  Cloudflare Pages, where they would start applying. The security headers at
#  the top are worth porting at that point; until then they do nothing.
#
#  If the host is ever changed to GitHub Pages proper, delete this file rather
#  than leaving it to imply protections that are not in effect.
# ============================================================================

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.woff
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, must-revalidate